OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 29 DEC
OL,4,G2300F6 Music Artist in Residence
OL,5,     GJoin Lucy Dacus as she takes us
OL,6,     Gon a journey of her favourite
OL,7,     Gsongwriters. She begins in the
OL,8,     G50s and 60s, with Dusty
OL,9,     GSpringfield, and a song from her
OL,10,     Ggrandparents wedding.
OL,11,G0000FIn Their Own Words: David Bowie
OL,12,     GDavid Bowie's remarkable story is
OL,13,     Gtold through interviews from the
OL,14,     GBBC archives.
OL,15,G0100FBowie at the Beeb
OL,16,     GAndy Peebles looks back at the
OL,17,     Gsessions and concerts David Bowie
OL,18,     Grecorded for the BBC from 1969 -
OL,19,     G1972. First broadcast in 1987.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
